      "spam": false,
      "value": "I would love to have more persistent worlds as a whole.\n\nto go from place to place, interact, kill monsters.... basically I want more MMO aspects in VR, but... I also want to just be my own character, my own avatar, like I've made in VRC.\n\nSecond Life has a persistent world.  One you can build and expand, and when you do things it stays.  I Want to see things like this.  And I think VRC might eventually get there, but I'm not certain.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
