  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Personally, I'd love to see the option of persistent home worlds added to the game.\n\nIt would be really interesting and fun for example, to have a white board in your room that your friends can draw on while you're offline and leave you message, or move your furniture around etc.\n\nThese are obviously very basic examples, but this idea could eventually be brought over not only to home worlds, but regular worlds as well.",
